  "prompt": "For the accounts created from July to December 2025, show how many used the product in each of their first four months, one row per cohort month that has accounts. An account's cohort month is the month of its created_at (Brussels local time). A usage week counts in the month its week_start falls in, and a week that starts before the cohort month does not count. Month 0 is the cohort month itself, month 1 the next calendar month, and so on. The as-of date is 1 January 2026: a month that ends after it is not known yet and shows missing, while a month that has ended with no usage shows 0. Return five columns, in this order: cohort_month (the first day of the month), m0, m1, m2 and m3. Any row order is fine.",
